{"id":"dfcee220c38e9805","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-suslin-aronszajn.md","title":"Suslin Trees Are Aronszajn","display":"thm-suslin-aronszajn — Suslin Trees Are Aronszajn","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-suslin-aronszajn","aliases":["58-thm-suslin-aronszajn"],"display":"thm-suslin-aronszajn — Suslin Trees Are Aronszajn","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-suslin-aronszajn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-suslin-aronszajn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-suslin-aronszajn — Suslin Trees Are Aronszajn"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc\" href=\"?note=ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md\">../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,&lt;_T)\">\\((T,&lt;_T)\\)</span> (tree)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\">\\(\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\\)</span> (Suslin-tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"47ecd1e17d0a4400\" href=\"?note=47ecd1e17d0a4400\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md\">../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,&lt;_T\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,&lt;_T\\rangle)\\)</span> (predicate on the coded ordered tree, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc\" href=\"?note=ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md\">../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash\n\\forall(T,&lt;_T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,&lt;_T\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash\n\\forall(T,&lt;_T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,&lt;_T)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,&lt;_T\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A Suslin tree is an Aronszajn tree with no uncountable antichain.</li>\n<li>The existence of a Suslin tree is independent of ZFC, but the displayed implication follows directly from the definitions.</li>\n<li>The order is retained in the coded argument expected by the upstream Aronszajn-tree predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md","status":"resolved","id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)$ (Suslin-tree predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-suslin-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md","status":"resolved","id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,<_T\\rangle)$ (predicate on the coded ordered tree, see [[../batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(T,<_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,<_T\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}suslin\\text{-}aronszajn}\\vdash\n\\forall(T,<_T)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{SuslinTree}(T,<_T)\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_{\\omega_1}(\\langle T,<_T\\rangle)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1112,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4451","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-thm-suslin-aronszajn.md|58-thm-suslin-aronszajn]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["47ecd1e17d0a4400","ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc"]}